      "text": "\n1) Prerequisite : \"setCurrentPrice()\"\n\n- get_current_stock_price function returns a random stock price between 1 and 1000\n(Can be improved to use float)\n- The range 1, 1000 is arbitrary\nAlgorithm:\nper each allocated_stock in allocated_stocks:\n    stock = allocated_stock.stock\n    stock.price = get_current_stock_price(stock.name)  # this IS the setCurrentPrice\nmethod\n        \n\n2) Rebalance algorithm \nMain Objective: first, calculate whether we should buy or sell stocks match the\npercentages per allocated stock, and then, sell and buy stocks in that order. The buying\nprocess is restricted to the earnings made in the previous step.\n\nIdeas: \n- I added an \"clp_invested\" variable holding the \"100%\" of the invested money. I did it\nthis way because I assumed that the portfolio is per customer\n- The prerequisite must be run prior to every rebalance execution\n\n    \nTakes O(N) assuming all operations to be lineal",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n1) Prerequisite : \"setCurrentPrice()\"\n\n- get_current_stock_price function returns a random stock price between 1 and 1000 (Can be improved to use float)\n- The range 1, 1000 is arbitrary\nAlgorithm:\nper each allocated_stock in allocated_stocks:\n    stock = allocated_stock.stock\n    stock.price = get_current_stock_price(stock.name)  # this IS the setCurrentPrice method\n        \n\n2) Rebalance algorithm \nMain Objective: first, calculate whether we should buy or sell stocks match the percentages per allocated stock, and then, sell and buy stocks in that order. The buying process is restricted to the earnings made in the previous step.\n\nIdeas: \n- I added an \"clp_invested\" variable holding the \"100%\" of the invested money. I did it this way because I assumed that the portfolio is per customer\n- The prerequisite must be run prior to every rebalance execution\n\n    \nTakes O(N) assuming all operations to be lineal",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
